# Intrepid Paleontologist: the permission is for "cards you own exiled with this creature" (CR 607.2a). Bot1's first Paleontologist exiles
# the Nest Robber (a Dinosaur Bot1 owns); a second Paleontologist enters. Lightning Bolt kills the first, and the Robber, still exiled,
# cannot be cast: not with the second Paleontologist, which did not exile it, with mana for it available (Forest and the second
# Paleontologist's mana, which was not summoning sick, CR 302.6) so the refusal is the permission's (CR 400.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Intrepid Paleontologist
Nest Robber
Lightning Bolt
Intrepid Paleontologist
Lightning Bolt
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

